# Along the Crooked Way {2}{B}: "When this enchantment enters, return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand. Whenever a
# creature card leaves your graveyard, amass Goblins 1." Both players discarded creature cards to Faithless Looting. On turn 3 Bot1
# pays the Along exactly with Mox Jet and Mana Crypt; the target is a creature card in Bot1's graveyard (Bot2's Memnite is refused),
# it returns to hand, and that is a creature card leaving Bot1's graveyard: a 1/1 Goblin Army token. On turn 4 Bot2's Gathering of
# Darkness returns its own Memnite, which is not a card leaving Bot1's graveyard: Bot1's Army still has one counter.

